mapping "V6990.1" source="V6990" target="220052006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 1 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6990 = SNOMED CT 220052006 (ICD-10 SE V69 fourth-digit extension coding the activity
        dimension). Target SNOMED CT 40417893 (220052006) =. The activity qualifier (sport) has no standard
        SNOMED CT representation; target subsumes the occupant/vehicle/collision-unspecified axis exactly
        but drops the activity axis, hence broader not exact. OMOP/SNOMED CT do not encode
        activity-of-injury in transport injury codes. Moderate tier: best available standard concept,
        mirror-verified, unspecified source with semantic breadth lost.
        """
}
mapping "V6991.1" source="V6991" target="220052006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 1 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6991 = SNOMED CT 220052006 (ICD-10 SE activity-dimension extension). Target SNOMED CT 40417893
        =. Same semantic mapping as V6990 sibling: target fully covers the
        occupant/vehicle/unspecified-traffic axis; the activity qualifier (play/leisure) is outside
        SNOMED CT's injury-transport scope, so the target is broader. Moderate tier: mirror-verified best
        available, activity axis unrepresentable.
        """
}
mapping "V6992.1" source="V6992" target="220052006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 1 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6992 = SNOMED CT 220052006 (ICD-10 SE activity extension). Target SNOMED CT 40417893 =. Target
        subsumes the occupant/vehicle/traffic axis; activity qualifier (paid work) not encoded in SNOMED CT
        transport-injury concepts. Broader. Moderate tier: mirror-verified, activity axis
        unrepresentable, best available.
        """
}
mapping "V6993.1" source="V6993" target="220052006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 1 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6993 = SNOMED CT 220052006 (ICD-10 SE activity extension). Target SNOMED CT 40417893 =. Target
        fully contains the clinical-injury axis; the activity qualifier (other) is administrative
        granularity without SNOMED CT representation. Broader. Moderate tier: mirror-verified, best
        available standard concept, qualifier loss only.
        """
}
mapping "V6994.1" source="V6994" target="220052006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
