    comment "en" """
        Source V6994 = SNOMED CT 220052006 (ICD-10 SE activity extension). Target SNOMED CT 40417893 =. Target
        covers the injury/vehicle/traffic axis exactly; the vital-activity qualifier has no SNOMED CT
